WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.690
Well, you're lonely, aren't you, Haru?

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.690
<i>I am, Dad. But so what?</i>

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.760
So we thought...

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.720
<i>Thought what?</i>

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.860
<i>What was it?</i>

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.320
<i>I have that dream all the time,</i>

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.810
<i>but I can never remember 
what Dad said next.</i>

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.550
<i>I have a feeling he said 
something important.</i>

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.590
Brother.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.730
Brother, are you awake? It's morning.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.390
Oh, shit! What time is it?

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:50.610
It's past 7:30 AM.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.390
What'd you do for breakfast?

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.970
Ren's toasting some bread.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:58.150
I'll never finish making his lunch in time.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.870
Could you give Ren some money?

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.060
Got it.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.410
That's unusual. You don't usually 
bring alcohol into your room.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:12.710
Huh? Oh, yeah, for a nightcap.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:14.350
Brother...

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:15.460
What?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:18.970
Aki and I are going to stay with 
the Sagamis for the next few days.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.350
Will you be okay?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.440
Of course. Be careful.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.860
Hey, Haru-kun.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.370
Mori-sensei?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:08.580
Ren-kun told me the place isn't as 
crowded on weekdays after lunch,

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.620
but it's pretty busy.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.530
They're all women.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:15.580
Oh, come on... What are you doing here?

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.130
I'm running an errand for Mikiko-san.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.870
Is Ren-kun here?

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:21.880
Yeah, he just got home. He's in the back.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.010
Ren-kun, it's good to see you again.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.890
Mori-sensei?

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.900
Mikiko-san suddenly asked 
me to give these to you.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.510
They're herbs.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.720
Seeds?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.480
She wants you to plant them in the yard.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.100
Can you do that?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.530
If that's what Mikiko wants, then it's fine.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.780
Landlady

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.510
Mikiko's our landlady.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:44.910
Really?

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.400
Oh, right. The area around 
the café is kept tidy, too.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.520
You're supposed to sow these in autumn,

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.480
so she said to plant them 
once it gets a little cooler.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.670
Got it.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.300
Is this how you always help around the café?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.170
Yeah.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.600
I'm not good at dealing with customers,

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.890
so there's not much I can do.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:12.860
But Mikiko-san said you take your 
work seriously and do it carefully.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:16.940
Come to think of it, did you 
not join a club at school?

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.970
I wasn't really interested in any of them.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.940
Maybe your interests are pretty limited.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.450
Limited?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.540
What if there were a dog club?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.800
I'm there.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.950
See?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.930
Anyway, how's Haru-kun doing?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.700
What do you mean?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:42.980
I caught the slightest whiff of alcohol 
coming off of him just now.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.200
It's not enough to warrant 
concern at the moment,

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:51.000
but if he starts drinking more 
every day, he needs to be careful.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.600
I don't get it.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:58.360
I've never really seen him drink at home.

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:03.040
He seems to be able to handle his liquor, 
so I've never worried about it.

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:07.390
Should I stop him if I catch him drinking?

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:11.120
If it's enough that you want him to stop.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.120
I can't possibly know that.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.130
If you tell him to stop drinking, 
I'm sure he will right away.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>This doctor is a quack.</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:28.090
Anyway, you and the twins are so thoughtful
toward your oldest brother, aren't you?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:33.510
Despite how clever he is, 
Haru-kun can be thick-headed at times.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:36.100
It's like he's used to being loved.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.770
Haru has trouble noticing 
the affection of others

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:46.110
because he thinks the person he wanted 
to love him the most didn't love him.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.870
<i>I see.</i>

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.740
<i>They're both sensitive to emotional 
changes in other people,</i>

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.470
<i>but they're dull when it comes 
to noticing their feelings.</i>

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.000
<i>Neither one demands anything 
in return from the other.</i>

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.800
<i>They know the other is a pain to 
deal with, but neither one can let go.</i>

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.130
<i>These two are...</i>

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.680
Moved

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:10.790
...so much alike, it's hilarious!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.560
Right down to the way you're 
fundamentally different!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.970
Ren-kun, I have something special for you.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:17.890
Huh?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:21.240
Aki-kun and Shima-kun once 
told me that when Haru-kun

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:24.780
returned to Japan from Canada and 
started living with his new family,

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.030
he wouldn't speak to them at all.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.410
Can you believe that? 
Haru-kun, of all people!

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.970
Mori-sensei, you have 
a professional obligation

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.410
to protect your patients' 
confidentiality, don't you?

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:38.730
See you later.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.420
What did Mori-sensei say?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.080
Mikiko asked me to do something.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.420
She wants me to plant herbs in the yard.

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.040
That's all?

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.740
We didn't talk about much else.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.430
Just small talk.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.950
Small talk with a counselor? Yeah, right.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.250
You were talking about all 
kinds of personal information.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.980
If it bothers you, 
I won't talk to him again.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.500
Sorry.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:12.650
Ren, I'm finished with work. 
Let's head back to the house.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.700
I'll go once I'm finished with this.

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:17.250
You can do the rest tomorrow.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.330
But...

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:24.130
<i>He was like this before 
Christmas last year, too.</i>

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.400
<i>He was weirdly obedient and well-behaved.</i>

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:33.430
<i>After that, he went back 
to Canada by himself.</i>

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.100
Come on.

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:43.110
Starting today, Aki and Shima are going to 
be staying with the Sagamis for a while.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.360
It's finally just us two again.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.360
Are you sure?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.670
About what?

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:51.950
Don't you have to go?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:52.870
Go where?

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.370
Well, today is...

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:01.130
The anniversary of your parents' deaths.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.120
Ren...

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.950
Is that important to you?

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:12.510
I know it's not my place to say anything.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:16.640
You idiot, that's not what I meant.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.690
Lately, it seems like you've had 
the wrong idea about something...

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.640
What are you guys doing over there?

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:27.650
Haru, aren't you finished working?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.650
Natsuo.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:35.160
Seriously? I wondered how you were doing, 
so I came to check on you, and now...

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:39.870
Hey, Ren!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:40.950
Ren!

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:44.070
Wait, Ren! Where are you going?

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:45.650
It's okay.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.130
I'll never go near Natsuo again.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.080
Like I'd ever do it with a brat like you!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.050
Stay away from Natsuo!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.150
Oh, right... I did say that, but...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:15.860
Don't worry. I'll stay away 
from your precious Natsuo.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.160
I promise.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:19.780
Huh?

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.280
C-Come here for a sec, Ren.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:24.500
Let's talk about this, okay?

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:27.450
Haru, are you just gonna leave me here?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.990
Shut up! Go home!

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:34.260
What's wrong with you? 
I came for dinner!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.260
<i>Uh... What's going on?</i>

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.420
<i>Where did he get confused?</i>

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:46.000
I don't want you to have the 
wrong idea, so let me be clear.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.380
You're important to me.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.480
You're a hundred times more 
important to me than Natsuo.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.520
Got it?

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.030
Got it.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:59.030
<i>Why does he look like he 
doesn't believe me at all?</i>

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:04.020
Why did you want to do 
that with Natsuo, anyway?

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.040
No, wait.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.040
It's because I said 
I wouldn't do it with you.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.040
No, wait!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.780
Were you that desperate to have sex?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.410
So desperate that it 
didn't have to be with me?

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.190
I won't do it again. I can't, anyway.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:23.910
I want you.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.410
But if you don't want to do 
it with me, then I'll give up.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:31.080
I'll give up on you, too.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.400
Huh?

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.370
I want you.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:44.660
But if you don't want to do 
it with me, then I'll give up.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:47.360
I'll give up on you, too.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:48.660
Huh?

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:52.900
<i>What did this kid just say? 
He'll give up on me?</i>

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.150
<i>After dragging me into all this, 
now he's saying that?</i>

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.890
<i>Is he threatening me? The little bastard!</i>

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.220
Haru?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.180
Take off your clothes.

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.640
Haru!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.560
Don't you want to do it with me, Ren?

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.030
Okay.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:28.300
<i>Damn it. It wasn't supposed to be like this.</i>

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:32.940
<i>I wanted to spoil him like a child</i>

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:37.570
<i>and make him say he can't live without me.</i>

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:43.130
<i>For some reason, I'm the one 
who's always about to say it.</i>

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.390
Haru!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.040
W-Wait...

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:52.390
Ren?

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:59.250
Ren, did just kissing make you...

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:04.000
Have you not been doing it by yourself?

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.760
I did, but...

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.020
But?

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:16.420
It wasn't working.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:19.920
Don't tell me...

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:24.600
That's not why you said you 
wanted to do it with me, is it?

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.180
No.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.930
Hmph

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.610
Then why?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.850
Ren?

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:35.020
Because... not mine.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:35.940
Huh?

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.580
Because you're not mine, Haru.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:46.950
You're always surrounded by women.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:52.270
At your previous job and your current job.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:58.930
I wish I could tell them not 
to touch you, but I can't.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:03.970
Because you're not mine.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:11.410
Did you think I'd be yours 
if you had sex with me?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.610
I don't know, but I thought it'd be 
better than being just your brother.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.880
Do you want me to be yours?

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.050
Yes.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.510
Then tell me you love me.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.240
I can't.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:31.830
Why not?

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:38.210
If I say it, those words will bind you, 
regardless of what you want.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:43.520
You always try to fulfill my wishes 
because I'm your brother.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.220
<i>This kid is so...</i>

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.210
Then tell me you like me.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.350
No.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:57.420
You wanted to have sex with 
someone you can't even say that to?

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:59.960
You really haven't been saying 
it all lately, have you?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.610
Saying it wouldn't change anything.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.110
It will.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.130
I'll be yours.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.630
I love you, Haru.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.680
I really love you.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:30.640
<i>Ren hasn't even noticed...</i>

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:35.640
<i>That I became his a long time ago.</i>

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:40.200
<i>That he holds everything 
in those small hands.</i>

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:46.540
<i>That even if he tries to let go, I can't.</i>

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.600
Haru?

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:58.700
<i>H-He fell asleep again!</i>

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:05.060
<i>He looks pale. Was he not 
getting enough sleep?</i>

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:09.680
Snore

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.140
I can't sleep without you, Ren.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:16.580
<i>Well, if he's mine, 
then it can't be helped.</i>

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.180
<i>Okay.</i>

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:26.120
<i>I was finally able to sleep soundly 
without the help of alcohol again.</i>

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.370
<i>Ren truly is great.</i>

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.940
<i>It's the anniversary of my parents' death,
but I'm lying down here.</i>

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:40.040
<i>I'm really sorry, but...</i>

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:48.300
Well, you're lonely, aren't you, Haru?

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.200
So...

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:51.590
<i>Oh...</i>

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:56.150
Ren-kun is going to be your youngest brother.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:58.160
Haru, take good care of him.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.480
What? Where did this come from?

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:05.980
He looked just like you when 
I went to meet him in Canada.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:09.250
He was hiding behind the dogs 
and grumpy the whole time.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.100
He didn't say a single word, just like you.

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:16.040
From the moment I saw him,

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:21.360
I knew it was fate.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.080
<i>I remember now.</i>

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:42.580
Ren.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.650
Will you go out with me?

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:55.290
Listen, could you confess your 
feelings to him somewhere else?

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:56.990
Wait, no! I got it wrong!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.040
Wrong?

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.660
No, I don't mean that!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.840
Could you come with me to 
the place I'm going to today?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.160
Where?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:08.420
I'm, um... going to visit my parents' graves.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.570
You've never been there, right?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.420
Are you sure?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.470
Huh?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:16.580
Are you okay with bringing me?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.430
You're not feeling guilty, are you?

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:19.390
No.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:23.490
Remembering the accident 
won't be painful for you, will it?

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.940
Uh, I'll be fine.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.690
There's something I want 
to tell them, anyway.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:33.190
Bro, please don't do anything lewd to Ren

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:35.650
in front of our parents' grave.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.740
What? I can't even kiss him?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.140
So you were going to.

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:45.420
Lewd? What does that mean?

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:49.400
You're such a disappointment, bro.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.080
It's a pretty place.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:29.950
Isn't it?

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:41.590
<i>Dad, Mom, I'm sorry I haven't 
been able to come before now.</i>

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:45.560
<i>The four of us are doing 
better than I expected,</i>

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.210
<i>so everything's fine.</i>

00:18:58.260 --> 00:18:59.990
Okay, let's head back.

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:53.960
Huh? Natsuo, you're here?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.860
Hey. Shima asked me to come,

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:00.110
but he's not even here.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.740
Oh, right. Shima asked me 
to give you something.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:05.980
Here.

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:06.870
Huh?

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:10.020
Ren, go get changed.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:10.720
Okay.

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:13.370
What is this?

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:14.830
An album?

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.880
They're pictures from when we were kids.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:21.880
Didn't your dad get rid of all of 
yours when you guys left Japan?

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.250
They're just the ones we had at home.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.900
Shima printed them out and put them together.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.140
Why would I need these now?

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:37.590
<i>Because my mother was in the hospital 
for so long with her weak heart,</i>

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:42.150
<i>the Kaidou family often looked 
after me when I was a kid.</i>

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.650
Haru-chan, thanks for everything.

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:50.620
<i>When I went to visit my 
mother, my cousin Haru,</i>

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.160
<i>who was a year older than me, 
would always come pick me up.</i>

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:57.670
Natsuo, you're not causing 
trouble for Haru-chan, are you?

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:02.170
It's okay. I love Natsuo.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.520
<i>You liar, Haru.</i>

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:11.600
<i>To him, the word "love" is lighter than air.</i>

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.060
Natsuo? Natsuo?

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:16.860
Are you listening?

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:18.060
Yeah.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:21.210
Haru, you haven't changed.

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:24.570
Of course I have. 
It's been more than ten years.

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:27.300
I'm not talking about your appearance.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:30.320
I'm saying even though it's been ten years, 
you're still all over your brothers.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:32.300
You're the one who hasn't changed.

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:34.710
You still act like a rebellious teenager.

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:38.180
Look! Do you remember this?

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:41.160
Aki and Shima begged us to put 
together a thousand fireworks display.

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:43.840
You used your whole allowance on it.

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:46.470
And it wasn't even a thousand.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.670
After that, the police were called 
on us, a fire truck showed up,

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:54.100
and I went around the neighborhood 
apologizing to everyone with Dad.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:59.100
I was surprised you were able to pass 
it off as the twins being mischievous.

00:22:59.290 --> 00:23:03.110
Well, yeah. After all, everyone 
thought I was a good kid.

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:07.270
But since Aki and Shima kept 
talking about how fun it was,

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:11.140
I was worried they'd ask me to do it again.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:17.190
What do they see in you that 
makes them call you nice?

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:18.120
Huh?

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:21.130
Nothing.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.210
Natsuo?

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.310
It's nothing.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.270
Next Time
